  <metadata>
    <name>hills-of-murgash</name>
    <desc>Off-road motorcycle ride from Buhovo to Murgash Peak (1687m) in Bulgaria.

The route starts with open dirt tracks before diving into forest trails and rolling mountain terrain. But the real highlights are the steep climbs and descents along the way — some of them seriously demanding, with incredible views opening up across the Bulgarian mountains.</desc>
    <author>
      <name>Tshushko Moto</name>
      <email id="contact" domain="twistandsmile.com"/>
      <link href="https://www.tshushkomoto.com">
        <text>Tshushko Moto</text>
      </link>
    </author>
    <link href="https://www.tshushkomoto.com"/>
